  "notes": "Install fixed in both venvs: astrbot needs telegramify-markdown>=1.0.0, but only prereleases exist before 2026-03-07. Installed the dependencies separately with telegramify-markdown 1.0.0rc5, then the project with --no-deps. Pinned apscheduler<4, pydantic<2.13, starlette<1 and defusedxml<0.8 to stable releases (wechatpy 2.0.0a26 left as is); added coverage. Most of the PR is new extension code (new_code_only), so the workload runs the changed existing code: the 'plug search' CLI via CliRunner with the registry download (httpx) replaced by a fixed stand-in; PluginRoute.get_online_plugins with query/limit against a local in-process aiohttp registry (new filter_plugin_market_payload path on head); and ConfigMetadataI18n.convert_to_i18n_keys with 'templates' fields plus the default config metadata. check.py passes: base 4.4 s, head 3.2 s, no-network OK. Changed-line coverage: head 54% (138/256), base 4/9. Outputs differ as expected: head ranks search results, filters the market list by query, converts templates, and has new config metadata."
